  "description": "The engine-neutral contract for video processing in .NET: analyse media files, read decoded video frames and audio samples, write standard MP4 (H.264 or HEVC with AAC) video from your own frames and sound, and transcode, trim and join files - through one interface that a separate engine package implements for each platform - plus a registry through which separate video encoder packages (such as AV1) plug in. Dependency-free; carries its own frame, plane, frame-rate and media-description types and needs no image library.",
